# Same-pass child slot reuse. Each child's first step emits analog 4 1 as soon
# as it is spawned; when the parent consumes a finished child it reuses its slot
# for the next child in the same pass, so the new child's first-step event is
# emitted right after the parent's value event (analog 3 N) without a hole or a
# duplicate. The parent's value proves the awaited payload was not lost.
analog 4 1
analog 3 1
analog 4 1
analog 3 2
analog 4 1
analog 3 3
